  "failureRecoveryEvidence": [
    "The final error screen binds retry to DomainManagementViewModel.onRefresh; the base error surface has no retry callback.",
    "NewDomainSearchViewModel retains the normalized query for onRefresh and uses debounce plus flatMapLatest to prevent stale completion.",
    "PurchaseDomainViewModel exposes ErrorSubmittingCart and returns to Initial before an explicit retry; no checkout action is emitted on failure.",
    "A null checkout result becomes ErrorInCheckout, while typed success and cancellation results return to All Domains.",
    "The details WebView rejects unsupported paths and hosts and emits an external-navigation callback."
  ],
